  "description": "Actual native derived primary-format wallet requirements and applied registry overrides. Configuration only; wallet names, platforms, specifications and deep-link patterns are not verified interoperability or delivery evidence. Null optional fields are omitted. The richer runtime projection differs from the pinned WalletProfile schema.",
